@base_url = http://localhost:8000/api
@admin_email = admin@cloudlab.local
@admin_password = password123
@test_user_email = api-test-ae98e967-eb7b-4594-b35a-2edd6ef6d549@cloudlab.local
@test_user_email_uuid_variable = api-test-{{$guid}}@cloudlab.local
@test_user_password = password123

# Ejecutar las solicitudes de arriba hacia abajo. REST Client conserva la cookie
# refreshToken del host y las variables @name permiten reutilizar IDs y tokens.
# La creación de workspaces requiere que Docker esté disponible para la API.

# =============================================================================
# AUTENTICACIÓN
# =============================================================================

### Login válido de administrador: guarda accessToken y refreshToken
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{admin_email}}",
    "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

###
@admin_token_login = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Perfil del administrador autenticado
GET {{base_url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login}}

### Login inválido: credenciales incorrectas (401)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{admin_email}}",
    "password": "contraseña-incorrecta"
}

### Login inválido: body que no cumple el esquema (400)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "no-es-un-correo",
    "password": "corta"
}

### Refresh válido: rota la cookie y devuelve un access token nuevo
# @name adminRefresh
POST {{base_url}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
@admin_token_refreshed = {{adminRefresh.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Logout válido: revoca y limpia refreshToken
POST {{base_url}}/auth/logout

### Refresh sin cookie: debe responder 401 después del logout
POST {{base_url}}/auth/refresh

### Login de administrador para continuar las pruebas protegidas
# @name adminLoginAgain
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{admin_email}}",
    "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

###
@admin_token_login_again = {{adminLoginAgain.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Endpoint protegido sin Authorization (401)
GET {{base_url}}/auth/me

### Authorization con token inválido (401)
GET {{base_url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

# =============================================================================
# ADMINISTRACIÓN DE USUARIOS
# =============================================================================

### Listar usuarios, primera página y búsqueda
# @name listUsers
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10&q=api-test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Listar usuarios con límite mayor al permitido (se limita a 100)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Crear usuario de prueba con correo dinámico
# @name createUser
POST {{base_url}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Usuario API Test",
    "email": "{{test_user_email}}",
    "password": "{{test_user_password}}",
    "role": "user"
}

###
@test_user_id = {{createUser.response.body.$.user.id}}

### Crear el mismo correo otra vez: conflicto (409)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Usuario Duplicado",
    "email": "{{test_user_email}}",
    "password": "{{test_user_password}}"
}

### Crear usuario con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "x",
    "email": "invalido",
    "password": "123"
}

### Consultar el usuario creado
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Consultar usuario con UUID inválido (400)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users/no-es-un-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Actualizar usuario creado
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Usuario API Test Actualizado",
    "is_active": true
}

### Actualizar sin campos: debe responder 400
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Intentar modificar al propio administrador: debe responder 401/403
PATCH {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{adminLoginAgain.response.body.$.user.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "No permitido"
}

### Login del usuario creado
# @name userLogin
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{test_user_email}}",
    "password": "{{test_user_password}}"
}

###
@user_token = {{userLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Usuario normal no puede listar usuarios: debe responder 403
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Cambiar contraseña: revoca sesiones anteriores y rota el access token
# @name userChangePassword
POST {{base_url}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "current": "{{test_user_password}}",
    "password": "password123-nueva"
}

###
@user_token_change_password = {{userChangePassword.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cambiar contraseña con la contraseña actual incorrecta: debe responder 400
POST {{base_url}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token_change_password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "current": "contraseña-incorrecta",
    "password": "password123-nueva"
}

### Restablecer contraseña del usuario creado; se muestra una sola vez
# @name resetUserPassword
POST {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Restablecer contraseña del propio administrador: debe responder 401/403
POST {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{adminLoginAgain.response.body.$.user.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Listar todos los workspaces como administrador
GET {{base_url}}/admin/workspaces?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

# =============================================================================
# CATÁLOGO DE IMÁGENES
# =============================================================================

### Listar imágenes visibles para el administrador
# @name listImages
GET {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Crear imagen Docker de prueba con referencia dinámica
# @name createImage
POST {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Imagen API Test",
    "image": "debiana:3.20",
    "description": "Imagen usada por restclient/api-test.http",
    "sort_order": 999,
    "is_active": false
}

###
@image_id = {{createImage.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Crear la misma referencia otra vez: conflicto (409)
POST {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Imagen Duplicada",
    "image": "alpine:3.20"
}

### Crear imagen con referencia inválida (400)
POST {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Imagen Inválida",
    "image": "no es una imagen Docker"
}

### Consultar imagen creada
GET {{base_url}}/container-images/{{image_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Consultar imagen con UUID inválido (400)
GET {{base_url}}/container-images/no-es-un-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Actualizar imagen creada
PATCH {{base_url}}/container-images/{{image_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Imagen API Test Actualizada",
    "description": "Descripción actualizada",
    "is_active": true
}

### Actualizar imagen sin campos: debe responder 400
PATCH {{base_url}}/container-images/{{image_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Usuario normal puede listar imágenes activas
GET {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Usuario normal no puede crear imágenes: debe responder 403
POST {{base_url}}/container-images
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "No permitido",
    "image": "busybox:latest"
}

# =============================================================================
# WORKSPACES Y DOCKER
# =============================================================================

### Listar workspaces del usuario
# @name listWorkspaces
GET {{base_url}}/workspaces?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Crear workspace: la API crea e inicia el contenedor
# @name createWorkspace
POST {{base_url}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Workspace Test",
    "container_image_id": "035880cd-d35f-11f1-a9d8-febbcf594172"
}

###
@workspace_id = {{createWorkspace.response.body.id}}

### Crear workspace con UUID inválido: debe responder 400
POST {{base_url}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Workspace inválido",
    "container_image_id": "no-es-un-uuid"
}

### Consultar workspace creado
GET {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Consultar workspace con UUID inválido (400)
GET {{base_url}}/workspaces/no-es-un-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Detener contenedor
POST {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Iniciar contenedor
POST {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Reiniciar contenedor
POST {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Consultar métricas del contenedor
GET {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Eliminar workspace y su contenedor
DELETE {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Consultar workspace eliminado: debe responder 404
GET {{base_url}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

# =============================================================================
# LIMPIEZA
# =============================================================================

### Eliminar imagen de prueba después de eliminar el workspace
DELETE {{base_url}}/container-images/{{image_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Eliminar usuario de prueba
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Consultar usuario eliminado: debe responder 404
GET {{base_url}}/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

### Ruta inexistente: debe responder 404
GET {{base_url}}/ruta-que-no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token_login_again}}

###
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Origin: http://linkmalo.com/